<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<?php include('head.php');
function capacityDate($value){$date=DateTime::createFromFormat('!Y-m-d',(string)$value);return $date?$date:new DateTime('today');}
$today=new DateTime('today');$defaultFrom=clone $today;$defaultFrom->modify('-6 days');$from=capacityDate(filter_input(INPUT_GET,'from') ?: $defaultFrom->format('Y-m-d'));$to=capacityDate(filter_input(INPUT_GET,'to') ?: $today->format('Y-m-d'));if($to<$from)$to=clone $from;
$loomId=filter_input(INPUT_GET,'loom',FILTER_VALIDATE_INT);$loomId=$loomId!==false&&$loomId!==null&&$loomId>0?$loomId:0;$target=(float)str_replace(',','.',(string)filter_input(INPUT_GET,'target'));if($target<=0)$target=10000;
$looms=$db->exec("SELECT IdTelaio,NomeTelaio FROM telaio WHERE EnableTelaio=1 ORDER BY IdTelaio");$endDate=clone $to;$endDate->modify('+1 day');$filter=$loomId?' AND ev.IdTelaio=?':'';$args=array(1=>$from->format('Y-m-d 00:00:00'),2=>$endDate->format('Y-m-d 00:00:00'));if($loomId)$args[]= $loomId;
$raw=$db->exec("SELECT DATE(ev.Timestamp) reportDate,ev.IdTelaio loomId,GREATEST(MAX(ev.LunghezzaDaInizio)-MIN(ev.LunghezzaDaInizio),0)/1000 meters FROM evento ev FORCE INDEX (index_evento_Timestamp) WHERE ev.Timestamp>=? AND ev.Timestamp<?$filter GROUP BY DATE(ev.Timestamp),ev.IdTelaio ORDER BY reportDate ASC",$args);
$daily=array();$productive=array();foreach($raw as $row){$day=$row['reportDate'];if(!isset($daily[$day]))$daily[$day]=0;$daily[$day]+=(float)$row['meters'];if((float)$row['meters']>0)$productive[(int)$row['loomId']]=true;}$days=$from->diff($to)->days+1;$total=array_sum($daily);$dailyCapacity=$days?$total/$days:0;$neededDays=$dailyCapacity>0?ceil($target/$dailyCapacity):0;$finishDate=clone $today;if($neededDays>0)$finishDate->modify('+'.max(0,$neededDays-1).' days');
?>
<body class="management-report-page"><div id="wrapper"><nav id="nave" class="navbar navbar-inverse navbar-fixed-top"><?php include('header.php');include('sidebar.php');?></nav><div id="page-wrapper" class="management-report-wrapper"><main class="management-report-shell">
<header class="management-report-heading"><div><span>ÜRETİM PLANLAMA</span><h1>Kapasite Planlama</h1><p>Geçmiş üretim kapasitesine göre sipariş hedefinin tamamlanma süresini hesaplayın.</p></div></header>
<form class="management-report-controls"><label>Başlangıç<input name="from" type="date" value="<?php echo $from->format('Y-m-d');?>"></label><label>Bitiş<input name="to" type="date" value="<?php echo $to->format('Y-m-d');?>"></label><label>Sipariş metrajı<input name="target" type="number" min="1" step="0.01" value="<?php echo htmlspecialchars($target);?>"></label><label>Tezgâh<select name="loom"><option value="0">Tüm tezgâhlar</option><?php foreach($looms as $loom){?><option value="<?php echo (int)$loom['IdTelaio'];?>"<?php echo $loomId===(int)$loom['IdTelaio']?' selected':'';?>><?php echo (int)$loom['IdTelaio'].' '.htmlspecialchars($loom['NomeTelaio']);?></option><?php }?></select></label><button><i class="fa fa-calculator"></i> Planı hesapla</button></form>
<section class="management-kpis"><article><span>Günlük kapasite</span><strong><?php echo number_format($dailyCapacity,2,',','.');?> m</strong><small>Seçilen <?php echo $days;?> günün ortalaması</small></article><article><span>Sipariş hedefi</span><strong><?php echo number_format($target,2,',','.');?> m</strong></article><article><span>Gereken süre</span><strong><?php echo $neededDays?$neededDays.' gün':'—';?></strong></article><article><span>Tahmini bitiş</span><strong><?php echo $neededDays?$finishDate->format('d.m.Y'):'—';?></strong></article></section>
<section class="management-panel"><header><h2>Günlük kapasite geçmişi</h2><small>Plan, seçilen dönem içindeki günlük toplam metraj ortalamasıyla hesaplanır.</small></header><div class="management-table-scroll"><table data-report-table><thead><tr><th>Tarih</th><th>Dokunan metraj</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $cursor=clone $from;while($cursor<=$to){$day=$cursor->format('Y-m-d');?><tr><td><?php echo $day;?></td><td><?php echo number_format(isset($daily[$day])?$daily[$day]:0,2,',','.');?> m</td></tr><?php $cursor->modify('+1 day');}?></tbody></table></div></section><p class="management-note"><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i> Bu tahmin geçmiş gerçekleşen kapasiteye dayanır; planlı bakım, kalite kaybı ve yeni sipariş deseninin farklı çalışma hızını ayrıca dikkate alın.</p>
</main></div></div><?php include('footer.php');?><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/management-reports.css?v=20260923-1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/report-table-sort.css?v=20260923-1"><script src="js/report-table-sort.js?v=20260923-2"></script></body></html>
